===============================================================================
  THIRD-PARTY ASSETS
===============================================================================

  Peaceful music (menu and map) — public/audio/ambient/*.mp3

    "RPG - Misty Mountains" and "Views From Atop the Jade King's Throne" by
    hitctrl, and "Bamboo Forest" by marcelofg55, released under CC-BY 3.0.
    https://opengameart.org

    Trimmed to ~100 s with fades baked in, levelled, and re-encoded to mono
    32 kHz 40 kbps. CC-BY permits adaptation; the credits above and on the
    game's settings page are the condition of use.

  Battle music — public/audio/battle/*.mp3

    "Legionnaire", "Juggernaut", "Vanguard", "Song Of The Forge" and "Terminus"
    by Scott Buckley, released under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
    International (CC-BY 4.0). https://www.scottbuckley.com.au

    Free for commercial use *provided the credit ships with the work*, which is
    why it is also printed on the game's settings page. If those files are ever
    removed, remove the credit with them; if others are added, add theirs.

    The files here are re-encoded (mono, 32 kHz, 48 kbps) from the composer's
    320 kbps masters — CC-BY permits adaptation, and the originals would be
    43 MB for music that plays at five percent volume.

