  of it, needs written permission first. Ask — open an issue titled
  "Commercial licence request", or reach the maintainer through
  https://github.com/zrg-team. The answer is often yes.

  This summary is a plain-language description, for convenience only. The
  licence text below is the terms. Third-party components and a note for
  contributors follow it.

